.git
.gitea
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
# Only the Tools integration guides are needed by the console build.
docs/*
!docs/tools.md
!docs/en
docs/en/*
!docs/en/tools.md
**/dist
server/internal/console/webdist/*
!server/internal/console/webdist/.keep
# The console build needs the workspace manifests, the web packages and the
# logo; everything else under design/ and apps/ stays out of the context.
design/*
!design/brand/logo/svg
!design/brand/brand.go
!design/ui-native/package.json
!design/gallery/package.json
apps/*
!apps/web
bin
data
*.test
coverage.out
